{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crowhallow is a PS1-inspired, single-player wave based shooter where your weapon is your only friend, the talking Crow, Lup.</strong> Battle surreal and nightmarish enemies of the night across spooky handcrafted environments. Upgrade your winged friend at the glowing braziers, and gain chaotic abilities. Refuse death, take charge, and survive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621490/extras/f2aec764d43bc3345c141fde59d125ce.avif?t=1761596365\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crow Combat: Command Lup as your primary weapon, and bless him with abilities like ricochet and carpet bombing that let you rip through enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knife Combat: Armed with your trusty blade, Kris, slice and dice any creature brave enough to challenge your wrath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-Based Survival: Face increasingly difficult hordes of monsters, each with unique behaviors and attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Visuals: Explore a handcrafted world inspired by the aesthetics of 90s horror\u00a0 games with low-poly visuals, crunchy textures, and an eerie ambience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast Movement System: Jump and Dash through combat with a responsive movement system, amped by upgradeable traversal system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621490/extras/bb6f5074eabf511858c6bfeafeffd2f7.avif?t=1765428403\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this surreal nightmare, survival means mastering your bond with Kris and Lup. Upgrade, improvise and face a growing sept of horrors until your sanity crumbles.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Call me Tommy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621490/2da2a56b04af654d36b8040c94447986e3331aad.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks, Lup!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621490/2da2a56b04af654d36b8040c94447986e3331aad.jpg"},{"name":"Angel May Cry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621490/a28e931d5e04fb2ad9d834fe892b37114fa4e642.jpg"},{"name":"The Endless Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621490/5356729033feebb6521b52b458e722f418c5888a.jpg"},{"name":"No More Ear Bleeding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621490/e12cf58298749f247d38f01f13a0dba951893eae.jpg"},{"name":"Midnight Crisis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621490/6948e12b63c6e4a8f217e61b44a33b151a2a443f.jpg"},{"name":"It Never Ends...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621490/21f31c001ad132429cb06c1905dfb7272b426987.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621490?t=1765829186","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621490/4a792354cd6c84a2e4590ad511de161429a6b526/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765829186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621490/56261d9636cb02e4b875c2a1a354c91938d10db4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765829186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621490/56261d9636cb02e4b875c2a1a354c91938d10db4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765829186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3